<p>Instill a part of your living curse into a weapon in your inventory, and toss it nearby. This nearly impervious sentry will attack all nearby enemies for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8, 10, 12, 14, 16</acronym> turns. When the curse ends, the weapon will drop to the ground.</p><p>Cursed Sentry attack speed (currently <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">60%, 86%, 107%, 124%, 140%</acronym>) will improve with talent level.</p><p>When you first select a weapon, it will be remembered and used as long as it's in your inventory. Use Choose Cursed Sentry talent to alter your selection.</p><p>At talent level 3, you get the ability to afflict powerful mundane objects (greater egos).</p><p>At talent level 5, you can corrupt artifacts.</p>